%% T2 — Enrichment tier ladder
flowchart TD
    A[Incoming record] --> B[Deterministic preprocess]
    B -->|escalate · free registry| C[Registry lookup]
    C -->|match| G{Name gate}
    C -->|miss · escalate · search and fetch| D[Grounded search]
    D -->|match| G
    D -->|no evidence · escalate · model only| E[Model inference]
